[gd_scene format=3]

; The Brink, east of the Chapterhouse (map offset (338.5, 6)): the end of the flooded layer, the lip of the first
; deep descent. A last pilgrim shrine under a broken dome, then the floor ends over a chasm no machine survives.
; At the lip stands the third law (LawBreak): a veil of glyphs the pilgrim cannot walk through, the law's words
; over it. Pressing on toward the drop strains against it until it breaks; then the jump, one way down to the
; frozen layer (Rimefall, sealed: not built yet). Until it is, falling past the goal's area shows the end of the
; build and the pilgrim wakes at its last shrine. The MapGoal of the built map is here.

